WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.667
New overnight.

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.801
Ukraine claims

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:02.502
it's gaining ground

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.503
and its counter offensive.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.070
A top defense

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:04.671
official says

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:06.339
Ukrainian forces are advancing

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.841
near the captured city of Beirut

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:10.176
and have retaken around 12 square miles

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:11.611
over the past week.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:13.446
This is new video of a Russian tank

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:14.881
you can see here being destroyed

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:16.316
near that city.

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:16.983
Now, Russia unleashed

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:18.485
another wave of drones

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:19.452
on Ukraine overnight.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.520
After striking key

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.655
for the first time in nearly two weeks

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:23.823
over the weekend.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:25.458
And an exclusive sit down interview

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:26.626
with CNN's Erin Burnett.

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.395
Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:29.162
says last

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:31.131
weekend's mercenary rebellion inside

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:32.098
Russia shows

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:33.700
Vladimir Putin is weak

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:37.303
and his grip on power is crumbling.

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:38.838
Mr.
President, you know,

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:41.441
you recently said that you have dealt

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:43.043
and I'll quote you the way

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:43.910
the way it quoted

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.678
with different Putin's

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:47.881
it's a completely different set of traits

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.582
in different periods.

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:50.450
Now, of course, he's

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.919
faced a rebellion, an attempted coup

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.021
from Evgeny Prigozhin.

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:57.390
Have you seen any changes in

00:00:58.158 --> 00:00:58.925
in how you think

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:00.660
he's acting in his behavior

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.895
since the attempted coup?

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:07.901
yes, we see the reaction after certain

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.269
Wagner steps.

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:10.804
We see Putin's reaction.

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:11.971
It's weak.

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:13.073
Firstly,

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:13.506
we see

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:15.141
he doesn't control everything

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:16.176
in darkness.

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:16.776
Moving deep

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:17.444
into Russia

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:18.278
and taking certain

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:20.313
regions shows how easy it is to do.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:22.082
Putin doesn't

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.451
control the situation in the regions.

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:25.552
He doesn't control

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:27.420
the security situation.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:27.954
All of us

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:29.889
understand that his whole army

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:31.691
is in Ukraine.

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:34.360
Almost entire army is there.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.963
That's why it's so easy for the Wagner

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:39.332
troops to march through Russia.

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:41.167
Who could have stopped him?

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:43.103
We understand that Putin doesn't

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:45.004
control the regional policy

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.106
and he doesn't control

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:48.274
all those people in the regions.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:50.076
So all that vertical power

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:52.912
he used to have just got crumbling down.

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:53.947
Do you believe

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:55.682
he's fully in charge of the military

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:56.116
right now

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:57.584
when it comes to your front line in

00:01:57.584 --> 00:01:58.718
this counteroffensive?

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:00.320
Do you believe

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.054
Putin is fully

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:04.057
in charge of the Russian military

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:08.161
I don't think he fully controls

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:09.863
all the processes.

00:02:09.863 --> 00:02:11.865
He gives orders to the commanders.

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:13.233
It's understood

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:15.368
They are scared to lose their jobs.

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:16.736
But he doesn't understand

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:18.872
and doesn't control the middle layer

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:20.240
of the Russian military

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.842
nor the lower rank officers and soldiers.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:25.845
Also new overnight, the Kremlin claims

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:27.113
it foiled a car bomb

00:02:27.113 --> 00:02:28.081
assassination plot

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:29.182
against the Russian backed

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:30.517
leader of Crimea.

00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:31.618
Now, in his interview with Erin

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:33.720
Burnett, Zelinsky said the war in Ukraine

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:34.621
won't be over

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:36.256
until Crimea is back

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:39.025
under Ukrainian control.

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:43.163
We cannot imagine Ukraine without Crimea.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:44.731
And while Crimea is under

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:46.232
the Russian occupation,

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:48.001
that means only one thing.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:49.769
War is not over yet.

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:53.173
To be clear, in victory, in peace,

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.775
is there any scenario where

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:58.244
Crimea is not part of Ukraine?

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:04.184
it will not be victory then.

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:05.752
I know the US CIA chief

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:07.187
Bill Burns has come and visited

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:09.222
you regularly. He was here recently.

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:12.392
What did you tell him about your plans

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:14.194
to take back territory

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:16.362
in the counteroffensive?

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:20.099
To be honest with you,

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:21.901
I was surprised to see the information

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:23.603
in some media, both in the U.S.

00:03:23.603 --> 00:03:26.072
and Ukrainian and European media.

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:28.107
My communication with the CIA chief

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:30.310
should always be behind the scenes

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.344
and the media attention

00:03:31.344 --> 00:03:33.446
because we discuss important things,

00:03:33.446 --> 00:03:34.447
what Ukraine needs,

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:36.783
and how Ukraine is prepared to act.

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:39.052
We don't have any secrets from CIA

00:03:39.252 --> 00:03:40.987
because we have good relations

00:03:40.987 --> 00:03:42.322
and our intelligence services

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:43.890
talk with each other.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.259
I don't know what were other contacts.

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:47.994
I don't really remember which media

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:49.362
I read it in.

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:52.131
The situation is pretty straightforward.

00:03:52.131 --> 00:03:54.234
We have good relations with the CIA chief

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.702
and we are talking.

00:03:55.702 --> 00:03:57.537
I told him about all the important things

00:03:57.537 --> 00:03:58.171
related to the

00:03:58.171 --> 00:03:59.439
battlefield, which we need.

00:04:00.873 --> 00:04:02.342
And you can watch Erin's

00:04:02.342 --> 00:04:03.209
full interview

00:04:03.209 --> 00:04:04.911
with Ukrainian President Zelensky

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:07.680
Wednesday at 7 p.m. Eastern.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.014
Now, you heard

00:04:08.014 --> 00:04:08.681
President Slutsky

00:04:08.681 --> 00:04:10.183
talking about his secret face

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:12.352
to face meeting with the head of the CIA.

00:04:12.485 --> 00:04:13.119
Let's bring in

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:14.921
CNN national security reporter Natasha

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:16.623
Bertrand and Natasha

00:04:16.623 --> 00:04:18.124
This was a fascinating development.

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:19.592
It wasn't public when it happened

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:20.493
or I think our Jim Sciutto

00:04:20.493 --> 00:04:21.794
and you have been reporting on it.

00:04:21.794 --> 00:04:22.862
Do we have any idea

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:23.997
what they talked

00:04:23.997 --> 00:04:26.099
about during the sit down

00:04:26.866 --> 00:04:27.267
Yeah.

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:29.269
So we have some sense from a U.S.

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:30.303
official basically

00:04:30.303 --> 00:04:31.838
reaffirming that Bill Burns

00:04:31.838 --> 00:04:33.406
did make this trip to Kiev,

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:34.874
as he has many times before,

00:04:34.874 --> 00:04:37.176
including as recently that we know of

00:04:37.176 --> 00:04:38.344
in January.

00:04:38.344 --> 00:04:39.445
And according to this U.S.

00:04:39.445 --> 00:04:40.780
official, Bill Burns

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:42.982
reiterated the US commitment

00:04:42.982 --> 00:04:45.551
to intelligence sharing with Zelensky

00:04:45.618 --> 00:04:47.253
Now, according to Zelenskiy himself,

00:04:47.253 --> 00:04:49.689
he did say that he shared information

00:04:49.689 --> 00:04:50.790
about the battlefield

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.292
and about Ukraine's counteroffensive

00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:53.326
with Burns,

00:04:53.326 --> 00:04:55.628
as well as what Ukraine actually needs

00:04:55.628 --> 00:04:56.863
in order
to be successful

00:04:56.863 --> 00:04:57.930
in that counteroffensive.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.232
But look, Burns

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:01.334
has been somewhat of an emissary

00:05:01.334 --> 00:05:02.435
throughout this entire war

00:05:02.435 --> 00:05:03.603
for the Biden administration,

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:06.172
not only to Ukraine, but also to Russia.

00:05:06.172 --> 00:05:08.574
And he has been taking full advantage

00:05:08.574 --> 00:05:10.643
of the trust that the president

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:11.811
has placed in him

00:05:11.811 --> 00:05:12.979
and his deep knowledge,

00:05:12.979 --> 00:05:15.181
of course, of Russia, of Ukraine,

00:05:15.181 --> 00:05:17.984
to play a really important role here,

00:05:18.184 --> 00:05:20.553
not only in serving as kind of

00:05:21.054 --> 00:05:22.555
a diplomatic, of course, emissary

00:05:22.555 --> 00:05:23.356
between the countries,

00:05:23.356 --> 00:05:25.058
but also, of course, sharing U.S.

00:05:25.058 --> 00:05:26.559
intelligence with the Ukrainians

00:05:26.559 --> 00:05:27.360
about what they know

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:28.328
about the Russian plans

00:05:28.328 --> 00:05:29.929
on the battlefield, for example.

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:31.531
And just this weekend,

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:33.366
Bill Burns, he was speaking in England,

00:05:33.366 --> 00:05:34.634
and he said that this is actually a

00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:36.903
once in a generation opportunity

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:39.105
for the CIA in terms of recruitment

00:05:39.305 --> 00:05:41.007
just because of the level of disaffection

00:05:41.007 --> 00:05:42.175
that they have seen

00:05:42.175 --> 00:05:42.909
by the Russians

00:05:42.909 --> 00:05:44.677
with Putin's war in Ukraine

00:05:44.677 --> 00:05:46.012
and with his leadership writ large.

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:46.646
Here's what he said

00:05:48.948 --> 00:05:50.083
Disaffection with the

00:05:50.083 --> 00:05:52.318
war will continue to fall away

00:05:52.318 --> 00:05:53.953
at the Russian leadership.

00:05:53.953 --> 00:05:54.954
That disaffection

00:05:54.954 --> 00:05:55.488
creates a

00:05:55.488 --> 00:05:56.723
once in a generation

00:05:56.723 --> 00:05:58.758
opportunity for us at CIA.

00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:01.728
We're very much open for business.

00:06:01.728 --> 00:06:02.862
So the US has been sharing

00:06:02.862 --> 00:06:03.996
quite a bit of intelligence

00:06:03.996 --> 00:06:04.764
with the Ukrainians.

00:06:04.764 --> 00:06:05.331
The Ukrainians

00:06:05.331 --> 00:06:06.766
don't always share as much intel

00:06:06.766 --> 00:06:08.101
with the US

00:06:08.101 --> 00:06:09.769
because, of course, of that big leak

00:06:09.769 --> 00:06:10.236
that we saw

00:06:10.236 --> 00:06:11.571
classified Pentagon documents,

00:06:11.571 --> 00:06:12.338
they have been a little bit

00:06:12.338 --> 00:06:14.507
more wary to share intel with the US.

00:06:14.507 --> 00:06:15.041
But the US

00:06:15.041 --> 00:06:16.209
still trying to do what it can,

00:06:16.209 --> 00:06:16.576
of course,

00:06:16.576 --> 00:06:17.777
to give Ukraine the information

00:06:17.777 --> 00:06:19.812
it needs to be successful

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:22.915
Ukraine is reporting heavy

00:06:22.915 --> 00:06:25.351
fighting along the entire eastern front,

00:06:25.351 --> 00:06:26.319
with Russian forces

00:06:26.319 --> 00:06:28.020
attacking in several directions

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:29.856
and making some advances.

00:06:29.856 --> 00:06:31.157
But Ukrainian officials say

00:06:31.157 --> 00:06:33.259
their forces are having partial success

00:06:33.259 --> 00:06:33.960
south of BUK.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:35.161
What they posted

00:06:35.161 --> 00:06:36.095
this video showing

00:06:36.095 --> 00:06:37.263
what appears to be a strike

00:06:37.263 --> 00:06:39.332
on a Russian tank in the region.

00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:40.466
And Ukraine says

00:06:40.466 --> 00:06:42.101
it's gradually advancing along

00:06:42.101 --> 00:06:43.669
the southern front lines around.

00:06:43.669 --> 00:06:44.537
But the UNSC

00:06:44.537 --> 00:06:46.539
and political class Sebastiaan

00:06:46.539 --> 00:06:47.440
joins us now

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.875
to discuss some of the latest lines

00:06:48.875 --> 00:06:50.777
coming out of this conflict.

00:06:50.777 --> 00:06:52.578
Clare, let's start with a rather

00:06:52.578 --> 00:06:53.880
startling statement

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:54.580
that we had from

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:56.082
Gregory Gregory

00:06:56.082 --> 00:06:57.850
Harrison, who's a Russian member

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:58.751
of parliament,

00:06:58.751 --> 00:06:59.952
who has said that

00:06:59.952 --> 00:07:03.055
700,000 Ukrainian children

00:07:03.322 --> 00:07:05.158
are now in Russian territory

00:07:05.158 --> 00:07:06.926
as a result of Russia's invasion,

00:07:06.926 --> 00:07:07.760
which I just had a quick

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:08.628
look at the statistics

00:07:08.628 --> 00:07:11.731
that would make it about 10% of under 18.

00:07:11.998 --> 00:07:12.598
Yeah, right.

00:07:12.598 --> 00:07:14.200
I mean, it's strange.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.902
This number is startling.

00:07:15.902 --> 00:07:17.637
High orders of magnitude

00:07:17.637 --> 00:07:18.704
higher than the 19

00:07:18.704 --> 00:07:20.106
and a half thousand children

00:07:20.106 --> 00:07:21.874
that President Zelensky said

00:07:21.874 --> 00:07:23.309
Russia had illegally deported

00:07:23.309 --> 00:07:24.510
as of early June.

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:24.911
He also said

00:07:24.911 --> 00:07:27.113
they've brought some 371 back.

00:07:27.113 --> 00:07:28.347
He doesn't offer any evidence.

00:07:28.347 --> 00:07:29.749
He then proceeded to use this

00:07:29.749 --> 00:07:30.650
as a way of accusing

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:33.219
Ukraine of mistreating his as

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:34.320
Ukrainian teenagers

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:36.456
in the southeast of the country.

00:07:36.589 --> 00:07:38.858
He does say that this is in recent years

00:07:38.858 --> 00:07:40.259
the timeline is kind of vague.

00:07:40.259 --> 00:07:42.195
Some of it might have happened before

00:07:42.195 --> 00:07:43.796
the the actual All-Out

00:07:43.796 --> 00:07:45.498
invasion of Ukraine,

00:07:45.498 --> 00:07:46.766
and he says that this is

00:07:46.766 --> 00:07:47.333
part of a program

00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:49.068
to protect orphans, children abandoned

00:07:49.068 --> 00:07:50.403
children abandoned in the war zone,

00:07:50.403 --> 00:07:51.971
and that they include in some cases

00:07:51.971 --> 00:07:53.072
their parents

00:07:53.072 --> 00:07:54.540
and the caregivers

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:55.675
if they were at orphanages.

00:07:55.675 --> 00:07:56.709
But this is really important to watch

00:07:56.709 --> 00:07:58.611
because obviously there is evidence

00:07:58.611 --> 00:07:59.245
that this is happening,

00:07:59.245 --> 00:08:00.012
enough evidence

00:08:00.012 --> 00:08:01.514
to frankly indict

00:08:01.514 --> 00:08:03.182
the president of the country,

00:08:03.182 --> 00:08:03.783
the president of Russia.

00:08:03.783 --> 00:08:04.917
Putin was indicted

00:08:04.917 --> 00:08:05.518
in March,

00:08:05.518 --> 00:08:06.385
along with his children's

00:08:06.385 --> 00:08:08.621
rights commissioner

00:08:08.621 --> 00:08:09.856
and particularly important

00:08:09.856 --> 00:08:11.791
to watch as we see Ukraine

00:08:11.791 --> 00:08:13.259
take another potential step

00:08:13.259 --> 00:08:14.861
towards justice in this war.

00:08:14.861 --> 00:08:16.262
In the next hour,

00:08:16.262 --> 00:08:17.096
there will be opening

00:08:17.096 --> 00:08:18.631
an international center in The Hague

00:08:18.631 --> 00:08:20.933
to investigate the crime of aggression.

00:08:20.933 --> 00:08:22.301
This is a leadership crime

00:08:22.301 --> 00:08:24.637
looking at the potential decisions

00:08:24.637 --> 00:08:26.439
that led to the invasion itself.

00:08:26.439 --> 00:08:27.507
This is the type of crime

00:08:27.507 --> 00:08:29.809
that really has not been prosecuted

00:08:29.809 --> 00:08:30.543
in any way

00:08:30.543 --> 00:08:31.377
since the Nuremberg

00:08:31.377 --> 00:08:32.879
trials of the Second World War.

00:08:32.879 --> 00:08:34.180
This isn't the tribunal itself,

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:34.614
but it is a

00:08:34.614 --> 00:08:36.415
perhaps a step on the path

00:08:36.415 --> 00:08:37.483
to that for a tribunal

00:08:37.483 --> 00:08:38.951
for Russia's leaders as a result of this.

00:08:38.951 --> 00:08:40.253
But what power does

00:08:40.253 --> 00:08:41.521
something like that have?

00:08:41.521 --> 00:08:42.855
It just seems like there's

00:08:42.855 --> 00:08:45.358
depressingly little muscle

00:08:45.358 --> 00:08:46.325
behind any of these

00:08:46.325 --> 00:08:47.460
international institutions

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:47.960
or perhaps

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.262
even the launching

00:08:49.262 --> 00:08:50.496
of this new international center

00:08:50.496 --> 00:08:51.597
in The Hague at this time.

00:08:51.597 --> 00:08:52.798
While the conflict is active

00:08:52.798 --> 00:08:54.500
and all of the officials involved

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:57.003
in Russian territory or in the war zone.

00:08:57.403 --> 00:08:58.304
You know, I think that's

00:08:58.304 --> 00:09:00.172
that is ultimately what came to mind

00:09:00.172 --> 00:09:00.573
when you

00:09:00.573 --> 00:09:01.574
when you see this comment

00:09:01.574 --> 00:09:02.575
from this Russian lawmaker

00:09:02.575 --> 00:09:04.143
saying 700,000 people.

00:09:04.143 --> 00:09:06.379
Why would you come out with that comment

00:09:06.379 --> 00:09:08.281
when your president has been indicted

00:09:08.281 --> 00:09:09.015
There's clearly evidence

00:09:09.015 --> 00:09:09.782
that this is happening,

00:09:09.782 --> 00:09:12.685
that the world sees this as a war crime.

00:09:13.653 --> 00:09:14.587
I think there is

00:09:14.587 --> 00:09:15.521
an understanding in Russia

00:09:15.521 --> 00:09:16.622
that there's not very much

00:09:16.622 --> 00:09:18.558
that can be done to actually reach

00:09:18.558 --> 00:09:19.926
the leadership of the country itself.

00:09:19.926 --> 00:09:21.327
But it would be very important

00:09:21.327 --> 00:09:23.095
symbolically for Ukraine

00:09:23.095 --> 00:09:24.530
to get this off the ground.

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:25.965
First question. Thank you so much.

